    "text_full": "Register now for early access to concurrent writes in the Turso Cloud. Join the waitlist\n\nTurso\nDocs\nCloud Pricing\nBlog\nChangelog\nFollow us on GitHub\nFollow us on X\nJoin us on Discord\nLogin\nStart for free now\nGenerous pricing for every stage\n\nStart free today, no credit card required.\n\nPayment frequency\nMonthly\nYearly\n\nFree\n\n$0\n\nSign up\n\nDeveloper\n\n$4.99/month\n\nGet Developer\n\nScaler\n\n$24.92/month\n\nGet Scaler\n\nPro\n\n$416.58/month\n\nGet Pro\nDatabases\n100\nUnlimited\nUnlimited\nUnlimited\nTotal Storage\n5GB\n9GB\n+ $0.75 / GB\n24GB\n+ $0.50 / GB\n50GB\n+ $0.45 / GB\nMonthly Rows Read\n500 Million\n2.5 Billion\n+ $1 / Billion\n100 Billion\n+ $0.80 / Billion\n250 Billion\n+ $0.75 / Billion\nMonthly Rows Written\n10 Million\n25 Million\n+ $1 / Million\n100 Million\n+ $0.80 / Million\n250 Million\n+ $0.75 / Million\nMonthly Syncs\n3GB\n10GB\n+ $0.35 / GB\n24GB\n+ $0.25 / GB\n100GB\n+ $0.15 / GB\nPoint-In-Time Restore\n1 day\n10 days\n30 days\n90 days\nAudit Logs\n3 Day Retention\n14 Day Retention\n30 Day Retention\nTeams\nYes\nYes\nDPA\nYes\nYes\nSSO\nYes\nBYOK Encryption\nYes\nHIPAA\nYes\nSOC2\nYes\nSupport\nCommunity\nCommunity\nCommunity\nPriority Email & Slack\n\nENTERPRISE PRICING\n\nCustom Plans For Production Workloads\n\nWe provide white glove support including your own emergency email, unlimited usage, dedicated infrastructure, and everything that comes with the Pro Plan.\n\nSpeak to us today to discuss a plan that fits your needs.\n\nContact Us\n\nSTARTUP PROGRAM\n\nBuilt for Venture-Backed Startups\n\nWe offer generous credits to help early-stage startups scale without worrying about database costs. Focus on building your product — we'll handle the infrastructure.\n\nTurso Credits\n\nGenerous credits to get your startup off the ground with Turso.\n\nTechnical Support\n\nPriority access to our engineering team for onboarding and beyond.\n\nEarly Access\n\nBe the first to try new features and capabilities as we ship them.\n\nEligibility\n\nVenture-backed startup\nRaised at least one round of funding\nLearn More\nFAQs\nWhen will I be billed for my plan?\nWill I be charged if I exceed my plan's usage limits?\nHow is \"total storage\" calculated?\nHow are \"rows read\" and \"rows written\" calculated?\nHow are \"Embedded Syncs\" calculated?\nHow do I contact Turso if I have additional questions or problems with my bill?\nDoes using Drizzle Studio or Outerbase from the Turso Dashboard incur plan usage?\nWhat happens when I enable Overages?\nWhat happens if I disable Overages?\nDo point in time restores cost money?\nDo Database Branches cost money?\nTurso Cloud\nQuickstart\nDocumentation\nPricing\nAPI Status\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\n \nEmbedded Replicas\nDatabase Branching\nBackups & Recovery\nPlatform API\nTurso Database\nQuickstart\nChangelog\nReleases\nCompany\nAbout\nContact Us\nSupport\nTrust\nBlog\nBrand\nRSS\nYouTube\nDiscord\nX\nLinkedin\nGitHub\n© Turso 2026"
